"Apple 拒绝了 Windows 设备认证（-80045）。上游也报告部分账号仍失败，请稍后重试；原账号和签名保留。" = "Apple rejected Windows device authentication (-80045). Upstream reports indicate some accounts still fail. Try again later. Existing accounts and signatures have been kept.";
"Apple 拒绝了当前设备认证（-80045）。本地 Android 认证受到上游已知问题影响；可在上方选择并启用 Windows 认证服务后重试。原账号和签名保留。" = "Apple rejected the current device authentication (-80045). Local Android authentication is affected by a known upstream issue. Select and enable a Windows authentication server above, then try again. Existing accounts and signatures have been kept.";
"Apple 拒绝创建开发证书（7460）：此团队已有开发证书或待处理申请，但本机未找到匹配的可用私钥。请从原签名 Mac 导入包含私钥的 .p12 后刷新本机证书；现有证书未被撤销。" = "Apple refused to create a development certificate (7460). This team already has a certificate or pending request, but no matching private key was found locally. Import a .p12 containing the private key from the original signing Mac, then refresh local certificates. Existing certificates have not been revoked.";
"Apple 未签发新的描述文件，已停止安装并保留原签名。请检查签名账号后重试。" = "Apple did not issue a new provisioning profile. Installation stopped and the original signature was kept. Check the signing account and try again.";
"Apple 未返回有效的账号或签名数据，请稍后重试。" = "Apple did not return valid account or signing data. Try again later.";
"Apple 登录会话已到期，正在使用系统钥匙串中的凭据重新登录…" = "The Apple session has expired. Signing in again with credentials from the keychain…";
"Apple 签发的描述文件没有延长有效期，已停止续签并保留原签名。" = "The provisioning profile issued by Apple does not extend validity. Refresh stopped and the original signature was kept.";
"Apple 要求双重验证，请在 AutoSign“签名设置”重新登录并完成验证码验证；已保留原凭据和应用签名。" = "Apple requires two-factor authentication. Sign in again in AutoSign's Signing Settings and enter the verification code. Existing credentials and app signatures have been kept.";
"Apple 账号中未找到此应用原有签名证书。已停止续签且未撤销其他证书，请在签名设置检查原团队的证书。" = "The app's original signing certificate was not found in the Apple account. Refresh stopped without revoking other certificates. Check the original team's certificates in Signing Settings.";
