"首次使用请通过 USB 连接、解锁设备并信任此 Mac。无线使用前，请在 Finder 中启用“连接到 Wi-Fi 时显示此设备”。" = "For first use, connect via USB, unlock the device, and trust this Mac. Before wireless use, enable Show this device when on Wi-Fi in Finder.";
"首次安装使用所选描述文件的签名团队，为每个应用单独生成描述文件；续签使用各应用已保存的团队和证书。" = "The first installation uses the selected profile's team to generate a separate profile for each app. Refresh uses each app's saved team and certificate.";
"首次安装前，请先选择描述文件" = "Select a provisioning profile before the first installation";
"首次安装前，请在签名设置中选择描述文件。" = "Select a provisioning profile in Signing Settings before the first installation.";
"首次安装或掉签后重新签名安装完成，请在 iPhone 或 iPad 上前往“设置 → 通用 → VPN 与设备管理”，在“开发者 App”下选择本次签名使用的开发者，按提示重新信任证书，再打开应用。若已显示信任，则无需重复操作。" = "After the first installation or reinstalling an app with an expired signature, open Settings → General → VPN & Device Management on your iPhone or iPad. Under Developer App, select the developer used for signing and follow the prompts to trust the certificate before opening the app. If it is already trusted, you can skip this step.";
"首次安装或掉签后：信任开发者证书" = "Trust the Developer Certificate After Installation or Signature Expiration";
"首次安装时由独立账号创建签名证书" = "The Apple account will create a signing certificate on first installation";
"首次安装请选择描述文件以确定签名团队" = "Select a provisioning profile to determine the team for the first installation";
"首次打开 AutoSign 时允许本地网络访问，并确认检查通过；拒绝后可到系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 本地网络中允许 AutoSign，再重新检查。在 Finder 中启用“连接到 Wi-Fi 时显示此设备”，保持 Mac 与设备处于同一局域网，再在“自动续签”开启后台任务。新版本或移动应用后也需先在前台完成检查。" = "Allow local network access when you first open AutoSign and confirm the check passes. If access was denied, allow AutoSign in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Local Network and check again. In Finder, enable Show this device when on Wi-Fi. Keep your Mac and device on the same local network, then enable the background task in Automatic Refresh. Complete the foreground check again after updating or moving the app.";
