"移除设备会停止其自动续签，并从 Mac 和手机 Store 的设备列表隐藏；应用资料和系统配对保留，可随时恢复。" = "Removing a device stops automatic refresh and hides it from device lists on the Mac and in Store. Saved app data and system pairing are kept, and you can restore it at any time.";
